# Goemon64Recomp-NX subset of DK64Recomp-NX switch/patches/gliden64.patch
# Target: gonetz/GLideN64 @ 41c7ba273a6c9afb43c0574cf3cf5d139182d070
# Applied by scripts/build-nro.sh (idempotent: reverse --check then apply --check).
#
# Included:
#   Combiner shader-save (HOME never reaches RomClosed)
#   Texture cache cap 8000 (matches __nx_nv_transfermem_size = 32 MiB)
#   atomicops.h: POSIX semaphore under __SWITCH__
#   GBI.cpp: RT64EX_Init after F3DEX (Goemon) and F3DEX2
#   RSP.cpp: RT64EX_OnCommand in the DL loop
#   RSP.h: RSP_SegmentToPhysicalEx (512 MiB RDRAM, no 8 MiB mask)
#   F3D.cpp + F3DEX2.cpp: unmasked gSPSegment (Goemon uses F3DEX / F3D_MoveWord)
#   gSP.cpp: no hunk — gSPSegment stores the base as-is; masking is in
#            RSP_SegmentToPhysicalEx (switch/gliden64_rt64ex.cpp)
#
# gEX* no-op (ENABLE / SETREFRESHRATE / MATRIXGROUP / POPMATRIXGROUP, no interp
# / extra FBO) lives in switch/gliden64_rt64ex.cpp, not in this patch.
#
#   TextureCache::update: promote wide CI texrect loads to one-piece BG
#   (Goemon parallax sheets; walking was a glTexImage2D storm on nouveau)
#   _updateBackground: address-keyed CRC for those sheets
#   TextureCache hits/misses accessors (nxlink texcache lines)
#
# Excluded (interpolation / 16:9 / DK64 harness — later phases):
#   FrameBuffer interp FBOs, GraphicsDrawer adjust/maxY, GLSL combiner
#   gDP scissor flags, gSP OnMatrix/OnVertices/OnDecision
#
